  culture: `<p><i>3asiir 2asab</i> (fresh sugarcane juice) is sold from juice shops with piles of cane and a noisy press, for a few pounds a glass. Juice shops are everywhere: mango, guava, strawberry and <i>sobya</i> (sweet coconut-rice drink, popular in Ramadan).</p>`,
