  culture: `<p>Pharmacies in Egypt are open late (many 24 hours), deliver to your door, and pharmacists give a lot of advice directly. Many medicines are sold without a prescription. Visiting sick friends and relatives is a strong social duty; bring fruit or sweets.</p>`,
